{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.quick-decision",
      "id": "quick-decision",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "先判断你是否愿意长期处理定义、数据质量、模型假设、不确定性和反驳，而不只追求漂亮结论。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "正向信号：会先界定问题和口径，再检查数据、方法与替代解释。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "谨慎信号：把相关性当因果，把单次显著结果当最终答案，或不愿记录限制。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "练习审三张虚构研究卡的七字段：问题、数据来源、样本/范围、时期、方法、结果、审阅安排（不确定性+升级对象）。A：问题=指标甲变化；来源=数据集甲；范围=样本甲；时期=时期甲；方法=未知；结果=估计甲；审阅安排=记录不确定性并将未知交研究负责人，缺1。B：问题=指标乙变化；来源=数据集乙；范围=样本乙；时期=时期乙；方法=未知；结果=估计乙；审阅安排=未知，缺2。C：问题=指标丙变化；来源=数据集丙；范围=样本丙；时期=时期丙；方法=描述比较；结果=估计丙；审阅安排=记录不确定性并将异常交指定审阅者，缺0。答案1、2、0。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.profile",
      "id": "profile",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "职业定义：研究经济与统计数据，准备报告或制定计划，处理生产分配、货币或财政政策等问题。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.profile.definition-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "研究金融、劳动力、农业等领域数据。",
              "用数学模型和统计技术解释现象并预测趋势。",
              "评估政策影响并提供经济关系咨询。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.profile.responsibilities-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "输入：调查、行政、市场或企业数据与制度背景。",
              "处理：定义指标、建模、估计、验证和解释。",
              "输出：报告、图表、预测、建议或政策方案。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.profile.responsibilities-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "先区分描述、预测和因果问题。",
              "保留数据字典、代码、假设和版本。",
              "把不确定性与限制和结论一起交付。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.profile.responsibilities-block.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "BLS说明经济学家还会做调查、收集数据并向企业、政府和个人提供建议。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.profile.work-context-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "bls-duties"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "工作通常在办公室独立或协作进行，部分岗位每周超过40小时。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.profile.work-context-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "bls-duties"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.onet-structured-fields-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "O*NET任务覆盖政策影响、市场预测、咨询、研究发表与经济标准制定。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.profile.onet-structured-fields-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "经济学家交付的不只是模型，还包括可解释的结论、限制和可复核材料。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.profile.career-quick-answers-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "对外建议必须区分模型估计与最终政策价值判断。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.profile.career-quick-answers-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "职业代码19-3011.00不包含以销售潜力或证券估值为核心的相邻角色。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "economists.profile.definition-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details",
            "onet-financial",
            "onet-market"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
